-- Director-General of the Ministry of Education to the organisation's
-- chairman, on the gradual application of the reform in תשע"ב–תשע"ה.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-5`

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the words the search found are
-- not on its subject: ‘אב’ is the month of Av in the letter's date; none
-- gives pay or other remuneration by sex.

§ `מכתב נלווה 1`

§§ `מכתב נלווה 1 — יישום הדרגתי`

-- akn:att_15__hc_1/p1 akn:att_15__hc_1/p2 akn:att_15__hc_1/p3 akn:att_15__hc_1/p4 akn:att_15__hc_1/p5 akn:att_15__hc_1/p6 akn:att_15__hc_1/p7 akn:att_15__hc_1/p8 akn:att_15__hc_1/p9 The transcriber's note naming the letter, and the letter's letterhead, date, references and address; no rule.

-- The Director-General's letter on the gradual application of the reform
-- in תשע"ב–תשע"ה, which the agreement encloses: (1) in תשע"ב–תשע"ד the
-- reform is applied in full in 50 upper divisions in תשע"ב, 100 more —
-- 150 in all — in תשע"ג, and 300 more — 450 in all — in תשע"ד.
@ref akn:att_15__hc_1/p10 akn:att_15__hc_1/p11 akn:att_15__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_15__hc_1__para_1/p2 akn:att_15__hc_1__para_1/p3 akn:att_15__hc_1__para_1/p4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the upper divisions added to the full application in` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y 50 100 300

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the upper divisions in the full application in` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y 50 150 450

-- (2): item 1 holds on condition that in each of those years the number of
-- upper divisions that may join the reform is not below that year's number;
-- an upper division that may join is one in which 75% at least of the
-- teaching employees who meet the conditions for joining have given notice
-- in writing that they will — §5(ב)'s threshold (oz-founding-5), which the
-- letter restates.
@ref akn:att_15__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_15__hc_1__para_2/p2
GIVEN staff IS A LIST OF `member of the school's teaching staff under section 5`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an upper division that may join the reform` staff IF
    `the school meets section 5(ב)'s consent threshold` staff

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `upper divisions that may join in the year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the letter's full application holds in` y `upper divisions that may join in the year` IF
    CONSIDER `the upper divisions in the full application in` y
    WHEN JUST n THEN `upper divisions that may join in the year` AT LEAST n
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

-- (3): in each of תשע"ב–תשע"ד the reform is applied in part in the other
-- upper divisions that may join it; (4): in תשע"ה it is applied in full in
-- every upper division the Ministry supervises.
@ref akn:att_15__hc_1__para_3 akn:att_15__hc_1__para_4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `among the year's full-application divisions` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a division that may join the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
      `supervised by the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `extent of the Oz reform`
DECIDE `how far the letter applies the reform in an upper division in` y `among the year's full-application divisions` `a division that may join the reform` `supervised by the Ministry` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `a year of the Oz part application` y AND `among the year's full-application divisions` THEN `the Oz reform in full`
        IF `a year of the Oz part application` y AND `a division that may join the reform`   THEN `the Oz reform in part`
        IF y AT LEAST `the school year 5775` AND `supervised by the Ministry`                THEN `the Oz reform in full`
        OTHERWISE `off the Oz reform`

-- akn:att_15/p1 akn:att_15/p2 akn:att_15/p3 akn:att_15/p4 akn:att_15/p5 akn:att_15/p6 akn:att_15/p7 akn:att_15/p8 akn:att_15/p9 akn:att_15/p10 akn:att_15/p11 The sign-off, signature and copies; no rule.

§§ `מכתב נלווה 1 -- illustrations`

-- The gradual application: 50, 150 and 450 upper divisions in full.
#ASSERT `the upper divisions in the full application in` `the school year 5774` EQUALS JUST 450
#ASSERT `the upper divisions in the full application in` `the school year 5773` EQUALS JUST (50 PLUS 100)
#ASSERT `the letter's full application holds in` `the school year 5773` 150
#ASSERT NOT `the letter's full application holds in` `the school year 5773` 149
#ASSERT `how far the letter applies the reform in an upper division in` `the school year 5773` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the Oz reform in part`
#ASSERT `how far the letter applies the reform in an upper division in` `the school year 5775` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`
